<title>INDIA: Top stocks which moved the BSE Index - August 26.</title>
<headline>Top stocks which moved the BSE Index - August 26.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index closed at 3433.55, 2.15 points or 0.06 percent higher than Friday's close.</p>
